# Compiled binaries. Leading slash pins to the module root so we do not
# accidentally ignore the `cmd/a2s-benchmark/` source directory that
# happens to share the name. `.bin` is the canonical suffix — the plain
# names are here for the transition period when older builds may still
# live on a server.
/a2s-benchmark.bin
/a2s-benchmark
/a2s-benchmark.exe
/chstats-backfill.bin
/chstats-backfill
/chstats-backfill.exe
/results/
